Package: rpbnb
Type: Package
Title: Bivariate and Random-Parameter Negative Binomial Regression
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Project", "Author", email = "wonstran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum-likelihood estimation of bivariate negative binomial
    (NB2) regression models with Famoye/Sarmanov or discrete-copula
    (Frank, Gaussian, or Clayton) dependence, and maximum-simulated-likelihood
    estimation of a bivariate random-parameter negative binomial model under
    either dependence structure, with a random-coefficient data simulator,
    diagnostics, and standard model methods.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    stats,
    compiler,
    maxLik,
    numDeriv,
    randtoolbox,
    MASS,
    pbivnorm,
    Rcpp
LinkingTo:
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    parallel,
    pkgload
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
